WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A room can contain a hundred details.
Your task tells you which ones count.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In a famous 1999 experiment, viewers counted basketball passes
while an unexpected figure crossed the scene.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Some never reported the figure. It was visible.
Their attention was occupied elsewhere.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
This does not prove that any commercial audio rewires attention,
or that a witness is dishonest.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before buying a guided routine, try twelve quiet minutes
for free and notice what the task changes.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then examine the exact product, the limits of the evidence
and the real checkout terms. No pressure.
